Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,H_ms,,0,0,0,,"Dia cuma GAGAK tanpa api suci" ... "Dia phoenix ke tidak, BUKAN urusan awak."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Siapa benarkan awak sentuh dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.44,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Feng Qiwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kerana orang luar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:08.26,S_ms,,0,0,0,,awak berani tangan pada Phoenix Emas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.74,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sakit ke?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.14,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sikit je...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Dia jelas-jelas cuma gagak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.08,S_ms,,0,0,0,,tanpa darah phoenix, tanpa api suci.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Malah auranya lain dari klan phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:20.08,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sampai bila nak tipu diri sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.02,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Betul, betul!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.96,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Cepat, pujuk dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.18,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Semua sekarang bergantung pada awak!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.58,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Dia phoenix ke tidak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:28.00,S_ms,,0,0,0,,bukan urusan awak.
